<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Dopravna opens Ekoagrobanka units.</title>
<headline>Slovak Dopravna opens Ekoagrobanka units.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's Dopravna Banka a.s. this weekend will open the branches it bought from Czech Ekoagrobanka a.s. earlier this week, a central bank official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The Slovak network of the Czech-based Ekoagrobanka was sold to Dopravna Banka by Czech Union Banka a.s., Ekoagrobanka's controlling shareholder.</p>
<p>-- Peter Javurek, Bratislava Newsroom, 42-2-563-3686</p>
</text>
